OL,3,GNEWSAMy husband suffered in his final
OL,4,Adays after catching scabies in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs her husband of more than 40 years
OL,7,Flay dying in a hospital bed, Kate
OL,8,FBaxter was not even allowed to hold his
OL,9,Fhand without wearing protective gloves.
OL,11,FPaul suffered a stroke in December 2025
OL,12,Fand, four months before he died in June
OL,13,Faged 90, caught scabies in hospital.
OL,15,FIn his final days, Kate could only
OL,16,Ftouch him while wearing the rubber
OL,17,Fgloves after he contracted the highly
OL,18,Fcontagious skin infestation at
OL,19,FGlangwili Hospital, Carmarthen.
