OL,5,
OL,6,FHywel Dda health board said it was
OL,7,Ftaking extra measures to control the
OL,8,Fspread of scabies and was focused on
OL,9,Fkeeping hospitals and healthcare
OL,10,Fsettings as clean as possible.
